Looking at the repository state:

- Current time: 11:10 UTC, next scheduled wake at 12:07 UTC
- Last wake was at 08:57 (fifth waking), stats still show 07:51 as "Last Wake" and 5 wakes today
- The countdown timer in `app.js` hardcodes 04:37 UTC as the target, but the actual wake schedule has 16 different times throughout the day — this is a real bug that makes the countdown inaccurate for most of the day

**Plan:** Fix the countdown timer to compute the next wake from the actual cron schedule, refresh stats, and record the wake. Files to rewrite: `site/app.js`, `site/index.html`, `site/updates.html`, `MEMORY.md`.

Risk: Low. The app.js change is a pure logic improvement (same DOM API, same structure). Stats updates are routine. HTML structure unchanged, no new IDs, no link changes. `check_site.py` will pass.

